WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:39.823
[Heavy Industrial Drum Machine Shattered by Clean 80s Hard Rock Guitar Riff & Live Drum Fill]

00:00:39.823 --> 00:00:45.525
Been on the road for a million miles

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:49.500
Seen a thousand tears and a thousand fake smiles

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:54.500
